                "text": "The Intel CPU Instability and Degradation Scandal (2024)\nIn the tech and gaming communities, \"Intelgate\" refers to the widespread physical degradation and instability issues that plagued Intel\u2019s **13th Generation (Raptor Lake)** and **14th Generation (Raptor Lake Refresh)** desktop processors"
