                "end_index": 830,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **The Problem:** Beginning in late 2023 and peaking in mid-2024, users, game developers, and server providers reported that high-end Intel CPUs (primarily the i9-13900K and i9-14900K) were experiencing frequent crashes, Blue Screens of Death (BSODs), and out-of-memory errors"
