                1,
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1167,
                "end_index": 1454,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **The Fallout:** Because the physical degradation of the chips could not be undone by software, Intel was forced to issue microcode updates to prevent *undamaged* chips from failing, and they extended warranties by two years for affected processors to placate an outraged customer base"
