              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1469,
                "end_index": 1722,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "The Meltdown, Spectre, and CEO Stock Sale Controversy (2018)\nIn early 2018, the term \"Intelgate\" was used by some European and international tech outlets to describe the fallout from the catastrophic **Meltdown and Spectre** CPU hardware vulnerabilities"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
