                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **The Problem:** Researchers discovered massive design flaws in the speculative execution architecture of modern CPUs\u2014heavily affecting Intel processors\u2014that allowed malicious programs to steal passwords and sensitive data directly from system memory"
