              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2793,
                "end_index": 2963,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **The Problem:** In mid-2015, more than 50 military intelligence analysts working for U.S. Central Command (CENTCOM) filed a formal complaint with the Inspector General"
